{"id":"arbeitsplatz","lemma":"Arbeitsplatz","pos":"noun","rank":4904,"glosses":["workplace","place of employment","employment, job, position"],"ipa":"/ˈʔaʁbaɪ̯tsˌplats/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/7f/De-Arbeitsplatz.ogg/De-Arbeitsplatz.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Arbeitsplatzes","plural":"Arbeitsplätze"},"formAudio":{"Arbeitsplatzes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/89/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Arbeitsplatzes.wav","Arbeitsplätze":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6b/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Arbeitspl%C3%A4tze.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich habe einen guten Arbeitsplatz.","en":"I have a good job.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/392036","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},{"g":"good","l":"gut"},null]},{"text":"Das hier ist mein Arbeitsplatz.","en":"This is the place where I work.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"here"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"my"},null]},{"text":"Du hast deinen Arbeitsplatz verloren, stimmt’s?","en":"You've lost your job, haven't you?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"thy, your .","l":"dein"},null,{"g":"lost, missing"},{"g":"correct"},{"g":"S"}]},{"text":"Wir könnten den Arbeitsplatz verlieren.","en":"We could lose our jobs.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},null,{"g":"to lose"}]},{"text":"Ich will eine Wohnung in der Nähe meines Arbeitsplatzes finden.","en":"I want to find an apartment close to where I work.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"domicile"},null,null,null,{"g":"mine","l":"meiner"},null,{"g":"to find"}],"phrases":[[4,7,"near"]]}]}